# Applied in order to the upstream commit pinned in UPSTREAM.md.
#
# Keep this honest: one file per logical change, smallest first, and every
# one of them explained in UPSTREAM.md. The whole point of a patch series
# over a vendored tree is that what is ours stays visible, so a patch that
# does six unrelated things defeats the format.

# Not ours. github.com/zlixas/xemu @ 99db5507, one commit, GPL-2.0.
# Vulkan via MoltenVK, IOSurface display path, fixed-function fast depth
# replacing geometry shaders, quad to indexed triangle conversion, NEON
# packed SSE, Xbox kernel idle-loop halt, poll-loop sleep detection.
# 56 files, +2270 -142. Splitting it into its ~8 separable parts is
# possible and is deferred until something in it needs changing.
0001-apple-silicon-fork.patch

# Ours. The desktop shell removed and replaced with a headless display
# backend. Deletes ui/xemu.c (SDL3 window plus GL context plus main) and
# ui/xui/ (50 files of ImGui), disables the GL pgraph backend, and defaults
# the renderer to Vulkan. Four stub functions cover everything the rest of
# the tree asked of the shell; that number was measured with
# tools/ui-symbols.sh, not guessed.
0002-headless-host.patch
